# Copy to ai/.env (gitignored) or export in the environment before starting the service.

# OpenRouter. Used ONLY by interpret.py, to turn a spoken sentence into one field value.
#   https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# Absent is a SUPPORTED state, not a failure: /catalog/interpret answers 503, and the app
# falls back to its local synonym/carrier tables and then to a visual grid. Onboarding
# completes either way. Turning this on improves comprehension; it is not load-bearing.
#
# 🔒 This key must never reach the app bundle. A key shipped in an APK is a published key.
# The phone calls web/api, web/api calls this service, this service holds the credential.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# What is sent to OpenRouter, when, and what is deliberately withheld:
#   docs/app/AI-Data-Flow.md
